      },
      "ruleCount": 4
    },
    {
      "id": "S",
      "title": "状态齐全（空 / 载 / 错）",
      "source": {
        "file": "docs/design/ui-v1/README.md",
        "anchor": "### 3.4 关键状态（验收硬要求）"
      },
      "ruleCount": 3
    },
    {
      "id": "D",
      "title": "密度与点击目标",
      "source": {
        "file": "docs/specs/003-ux-quality-line.md",
        "anchor": "点击目标 ≥44×44"
      },
      "ruleCount": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "X",
      "title": "文案一致性",
      "source": {
        "file": "docs/design/ui-v1/README.md",
        "anchor": "状态名一律用同一套稳定名"
      },
      "ruleCount": 1
    }
  ],
  "criteria": [
    {
      "id": "T-001",
      "family": "T",
      "statement": "界面源码的样式里不出现字面色值（hex / rgb() / hsl()），颜色一律从 token 取",
      "check": "static",
      "evidence": "file-line",
      "severity": "blocker",
      "appliesTo": {
        "kind": "all"
      },
      "source": {
        "file": "docs/design/ui-v1/shared/设计token字典.md",
        "anchor": "1. 本文件**不出现**色值（`#rrggbb` / `rgb()` / 颜色名）、px / rem / em 数值。"
      },
      "humanReason": null,
      "tombstone": false
    },
    {
      "id": "T-002",
      "family": "T",
      "statement": "样式的注入点收敛在单一消费层：界面面的源文件里没有自己注入的 `<style>`，每个面板不再各写一份样式表",
      "check": "static",
      "evidence": "file-line",
      "severity": "major",
      "appliesTo": {
        "kind": "all"
      },
      "source": {
        "file": "docs/design/ui-v1/shared/设计token字典.md",
        "anchor": "2. 线框里**不写 token**（线框只写结构与文案位），token 只出现在组件树与该屏第 9 节。"
      },
      "humanReason": null,
      "tombstone": false
    },
    {
      "id": "T-003",
      "family": "T",
      "statement": "断点不写字面值：`@media` 的宽窄屏分界只走 `--xs-size-breakpoint-wide`（1100px）的语义，样式里不出现 `min-width: 1100px` / `max-width: 700px` 这类字面 px",
      "check": "static",
      "evidence": "file-line",
      "severity": "major",
      "appliesTo": {
        "kind": "all"
      },
      "source": {
        "file": "docs/design/ui-v1/shared/设计token字典.md",
        "anchor": "、px / rem / em 数值。"
      },
      "humanReason": null,
      "tombstone": false
    },
    {
      "id": "T-004",
      "family": "T",
      "statement": "颜色声明一律从 token 取：`color` / `background` / `border*` / `box-shadow` 的值是 `var(--…)`，或是允许的关键字（transparent / inherit / none / currentColor）",
      "check": "static",
      "evidence": "file-line",
      "severity": "major",
      "appliesTo": {
        "kind": "all"
      },
      "source": {
        "file": "docs/design/ui-v1/shared/设计token字典.md",
        "anchor": "（`#rrggbb` / `rgb()` / 颜色名）"
      },
      "humanReason": null,
      "tombstone": false
    },
    {
      "id": "S-001",
      "family": "S",
      "statement": "每个界面面的源文件（同一文件内）既有「判空分支」（`kind === 'empty'` / `!x.length` / `x.length === 0` / 状态标记属性）又有一句中文空态说明；只有注释、只有一个字符串常量、或只有类型里的状态名，都算缺空态",
      "check": "static",
      "evidence": "file-line",
      "severity": "major",
      "appliesTo": {
        "kind": "all"
      },
      "source": {
        "file": "docs/design/ui-v1/README.md",
        "anchor": "空态必须可执行"
      },
      "humanReason": null,
      "tombstone": false
    },
    {
      "id": "S-002",
      "family": "S",
      "statement": "每个界面面的源文件（同一文件内）既有「加载 / 进行中分支」（`loading` / `busy` / `running` / `pending` 出现在条件里，或状态标记属性点名 loading / pending）又有可见的加载证据（一句「正在…」或「…中」中文，或骨架屏标记 `xs-skeleton` / `data-xuanshu-skeleton`）；只有一个 loading 变量而没有可见证据，算缺加载态",
      "check": "static",
      "evidence": "file-line",
      "severity": "major",
      "appliesTo": {
        "kind": "all"
      },
      "source": {
        "file": "docs/design/ui-v1/README.md",
        "anchor": "首屏 `loading` 用**卡级骨架**"
      },
      "humanReason": null,
      "tombstone": false
    },
    {
      "id": "S-003",
      "family": "S",
      "statement": "每个界面面的源文件（同一文件内）既有「错误分支」（`error` / `failed` / `failure` 出现在条件里，或错误状态标记属性）又有一句中文失败说明（「失败」「读不到」「打不开」「不可用」等）；错误行只把 `{error}` 变量原样直出、没有一句固定中文说法，算缺错误态",
      "check": "static",
      "evidence": "file-line",
      "severity": "major",
      "appliesTo": {
        "kind": "all"
      },
      "source": {
        "file": "docs/design/ui-v1/README.md",
        "anchor": "`空态`、`加载态`、`错误态` 三种"
      },
      "humanReason": null,
      "tombstone": false
    },
    {
      "id": "D-001",
      "family": "D",
      "statement": "每个可点目标的可点区域不小于 44×44 CSS 像素（留白档：控件少而大，点得准）",
      "check": "browser",
      "evidence": "computed-style",
      "severity": "major",
      "appliesTo": {
        "kind": "rendered"
      },
      "source": {
        "file": "docs/specs/003-ux-quality-line.md",
        "anchor": "点击目标 ≥44×44"
      },
      "humanReason": null,
      "tombstone": false
    },
    {
      "id": "X-001",
      "family": "X",
      "statement": "同一状态在所有界面面只用一套说法：空态只许「还没有…」「没有…」，加载态只许「正在…」「…中」，错误态只许「失败」「读不到」「打不开」「不可用」——「暂无」「空的」「加载中」「读取中」「请稍候」「出错」「错误」「异常」这类同义替换不许与它们并存；且错误行旁边必须有可执行的下一步（重试 / 换个 / 请在…），只有一句「失败了」不算",
      "check": "static",
      "evidence": "file-line",
      "severity": "major",
      "appliesTo": {
        "kind": "all"
      },
      "source": {
        "file": "docs/design/ui-v1/README.md",
        "anchor": "在同一屏内复用，不新造同义词"
      },
      "humanReason": null,
      "tombstone": false
    }
  ],
